<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Practical 15 - CSS Effects</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f4f0ff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .card {
            max-width: 400px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 30px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px #cccccc;
            transition: transform 0.4s, box-shadow 0.4s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px) scale(1.03);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 25px #aaaaaa;
        }

        .button {
            background: #6c3fc5;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
        }

        .button:hover {
            background: #452080;
            transform: scale(1.1);
        }

        .circle {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            background: #ff9800;
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: bounce 2s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes bounce {
            0%, 100% {
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
            50% {
                transform: translateY(-20px);
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <h1>Interactive Webpage</h1>
    <p>Explore hover effects, transitions, and animations.</p>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="circle"></div>

        <h2>CSS Effects</h2>
        <p>Move your pointer over the card and button to see the effects.</p>

        <button class="button"
                onclick="alert('You clicked the button!')">
            Click Me
        </button>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
